WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A failing judge job is retried; the third failure in a row becomes a debug case.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The case runs in the background, so your work is never stopped.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
It reruns the failed step once, in case the failure was momentary.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
If the rerun passes, the case is resolved. If not, iaso is fixed on a branch.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.000
The fix needs a cause, a failing test, the fix, green tests, nothing stale, and a passed judge review.

6
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Main waits for your word. The workflow never approves anything or changes what a record means.

7
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Recap: iaso's own failures stay with iaso, fixed on a branch, and you decide what lands.

